 Transformation and action and lazy evalution:

what is transformation:
 we apply the transformation on  rdd or dataframes which will gives a new dataset 
example of transformation:

select ,filter,map,flatmap

actions:

actions  trigger are actually executed on pre defined transformation and give the result

example of actions:
count,show,collect()

lazy evalution:
spark uses the lazy evalution concept  it means transformation are not executed until action is called
 this lazy evalution build the spark an optimized dag(directed acylic graph) helps to avoid unneccasy computuion

benefits of lazy evalution:

query optimization
avoid unnecessary computuaion
fault tolerance
memory effiecient
